      "lines": [
        "---",
        "name: reconcile-ledger",
        "description: Matches the month's open supplier invoices against the bills in the accounting system",
        "---",
        "",
        "# Reconcile the ledger",
        "",
        "1. Query the open invoices for the closing month through the postgres server.",
        "2. Fetch the bills for the same month from QuickBooks:",
        "",
        "       curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer {{invoiceQuickbooksToken}}\" \\",
        "         \"https://sandbox-quickbooks.api.intuit.com/v3/company/0000000000/query?query=select%20*%20from%20Bill\"",
        "",
        "3. Match each invoice to a bill on supplier and an amount within 2 percent.",
        "4. Post the invoices left without a match with the slack server."
      ]
    },
